@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F6
skinparam classBorderColor #183D50
skinparam ArrowColor #183D50
hide empty members
hide footbox
actor Guest
participant "controller:\nRentalController" as C
participant "service:\nRentalService" as S
participant "renderer:\nRentalRenderer" as R
Guest -> C : search(criteria)
activate C
C -> S : search(criteria)
activate S
note over S
 Validate dates and guest count.
 Filter active apartments by city, capacity
 and availability using loaded records.
 Domain calls summarized here.
end note
S --> C : Result(OK, matchingApartments)
deactivate S
C -> R : render(result)
activate R
R --> C : screen updated
deactivate R
C --> Guest : Result(OK, matchingApartments)
deactivate C
@enduml
